From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:06:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Zeppelin F-234: HD data files read from the MPQs

- HD::DataFile::Read: forever_data\... and CataWater\... come from the MPQs
  first, the loose file next to the exe (or two levels up) second
- Forever lights/ambient/sky/fog/grading, hdWater liquid, FFT waves, Cata
  water runtime and ripples, and both grading LUT readers use it
- Vulkan grading prewarm takes its LUT ids from hd_forever_grading.txt
  (an MPQ cannot be listed)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
